      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Flor. Enquanto está fechado em forma de botão, Cherrim quase não se move e espera a luz do sol. Suas pétalas dobradas são resistentes o bastante para suportar bicadas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 8 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Cherrim é a evolução final de Cherubi.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Flower Shield, Growth, Leafage, Leech Seed, Morning Sun, Petal Dance, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Helping Hand</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Magical Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Sunny Day</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Worry Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Lucky Chant, Petal Blizzard, Solar Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Bullet Seed, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Giga Impact, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Laser Focus, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Play Rough, Protect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Solar Blade, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Toxic, Weather Ball, Worry Seed</p>",
